#. Crowdin string ID: 6705967
msgctxt ""
"MovieAnimation['1. To disable the animation status, click \n"
"this button.']"
msgid ""
"1. To disable the animation status, click \n"
"this button."
msgstr ""
"1. Klicka på den här knappen för\n"
"att inaktivera animeringsstatusen."

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705969
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['There is no movie object enabled to animate!']"
msgid "There is no movie object enabled to animate!"
msgstr "Det finns inget aktiverat filmobjekt att animera!"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705971
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Return to beginning']"
msgid "Return to beginning"
msgstr "Återgå till början"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705973
msgctxt ""
"MovieAnimation['1. On the first click, it returns to the \n"
"beginning of the animation of the \n"
"current camera/objects and resets them. \n"
"if record is on it will turn off.\n"
"\n"
"2. On the second click, it goes to the \n"
"end of the animation of the \n"
"previous camera/objects (if so).']"
msgid ""
"1. On the first click, it returns to the \n"
"beginning of the animation of the \n"
"current camera/objects and resets them. \n"
"if record is on it will turn off.\n"
"\n"
"2. On the second click, it goes to the \n"
"end of the animation of the \n"
"previous camera/objects (if so)."
msgstr ""
"1. Vid första klicket återgår den\n"
"till början av den aktuella kamerans\n"
"eller de aktuella objektens\n"
"animering och återställer dem. Om\n"
"inspelning är på stängs den av. 2.\n"
"Vid andra klicket går den till\n"
"slutet av den föregående kamerans\n"
"eller de föregående objektens animering, om sådan finns."

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705975
msgctxt ""
"MovieAnimation['Connection is enable, you must select \n"
"one connection in “Cam_07Connection“!']"
msgid ""
"Connection is enable, you must select \n"
"one connection in “Cam_07Connection“!"
msgstr ""
"Anslutningen är aktiverad. Du måste\n"
"välja en anslutning i ”Cam_07Connection”!"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705977
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Take a step back']"
msgid "Take a step back"
msgstr "Gå ett steg tillbaka"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705979
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Moves the animation one step back.']"
msgid "Moves the animation one step back."
msgstr "Flyttar animeringen ett steg tillbaka."

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705981
msgctxt ""
"MovieAnimation['Take a step back does not work \n"
"with ExplodedAssembly!']"
msgid ""
"Take a step back does not work \n"
"with ExplodedAssembly!"
msgstr ""
"Gå ett steg tillbaka\n"
"fungerar inte med ExplodedAssembly!"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705983
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Play backward the animation']"
msgid "Play backward the animation"
msgstr "Spela upp animeringen baklänges"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705985
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Plays backward the animation.']"
msgid "Plays backward the animation."
msgstr "Spelar upp animeringen baklänges."

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705987
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Pause the animation']"
msgid "Pause the animation"
msgstr "Pausa animeringen"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705989
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Pauses the animation.']"
msgid "Pauses the animation."
msgstr "Pausar animeringen."

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705991
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Play the animation']"
msgid "Play the animation"
msgstr "Spela upp animeringen"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705993
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Plays the animation.']"
msgid "Plays the animation."
msgstr "Spelar upp animeringen."

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705995
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Move one step forward']"
msgid "Move one step forward"
msgstr "Gå ett steg framåt"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705997
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Moves the animation one step forward.']"
msgid "Moves the animation one step forward."
msgstr "Flyttar animeringen ett steg framåt."

#. Crowdin string ID: 6705999
msgctxt ""
"MovieAnimation['Move one step forward, \n"
"does not work with ExplodedAssembly!']"
msgid ""
"Move one step forward, \n"
"does not work with ExplodedAssembly!"
msgstr ""
"Gå ett steg framåt fungerar\n"
"inte med ExplodedAssembly!"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6706001
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Move to the end']"
msgid "Move to the end"
msgstr "Flytta till slutet"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6706003
msgctxt ""
"MovieAnimation['1. On the first click, it moves to the \n"
"end of the animation of the current \n"
"camera/objects.\n"
"\n"
"2. On the second click, it goes to the \n"
"beginning of the animation of the \n"
"next camera/objects (if so).']"
msgid ""
"1. On the first click, it moves to the \n"
"end of the animation of the current \n"
"camera/objects.\n"
"\n"
"2. On the second click, it goes to the \n"
"beginning of the animation of the \n"
"next camera/objects (if so)."
msgstr ""
"1. Vid första klicket flyttas\n"
"den till slutet av den\n"
"aktuella kamerans eller de\n"
"aktuella objektens animering.\n"
"2. Vid andra klicket går den\n"
"till början av nästa kameras\n"
"eller nästa objekts animering, om sådan finns."

#. Crowdin string ID: 6706005
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Set position A']"
msgid "Set position A"
msgstr "Ange position A"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6706007
msgctxt ""
"MovieAnimation['Applicable for creating an animation from \n"
"point A to B (not when the MovieCamera \n"
"target or MovieObjects are set up to \n"
"follow a route).\n"
"\n"
"1. First, select and activate the \n"
"MovieCamera or MovieObjects you want \n"
"to configure.\n"
"\n"
"2. For MovieCameras, position the 3D \n"
"view with the desired framing to be the start \n"
"of the animation (position A), then click on \n"
"Set position A.\n"
"\n"
"3. For MovieObjects, position, rotate \n"
"or keep them in their current position, \n"
"then click on this button.']"
msgid ""
"Applicable for creating an animation from \n"
"point A to B (not when the MovieCamera \n"
"target or MovieObjects are set up to \n"
"follow a route).\n"
"\n"
"1. First, select and activate the \n"
"MovieCamera or MovieObjects you want \n"
"to configure.\n"
"\n"
"2. For MovieCameras, position the 3D \n"
"view with the desired framing to be the start \n"
"of the animation (position A), then click on \n"
"Set position A.\n"
"\n"
"3. For MovieObjects, position, rotate \n"
"or keep them in their current position, \n"
"then click on this button."
msgstr ""
"Gäller för att skapa en\n"
"animering från punkt A till\n"
"B (inte när målet för\n"
"MovieCamera eller\n"
"MovieObjects är inställt\n"
"att följa en väg). 1. Välj\n"
"först och aktivera den\n"
"MovieCamera eller de\n"
"MovieObjects som du vill\n"
"konfigurera. 2. För\n"
"MovieCamera: placera 3D-vyn\n"
"med önskad inramning vid\n"
"början av animeringen\n"
"(position A) och klicka\n"
"sedan på Ange position A.\n"
"3. För MovieObjects:\n"
"placera, rotera eller behåll dem i deras nuvarande position och klicka sedan på den här knappen."

#. Crowdin string ID: 6706009
msgctxt "MovieAnimation['Set position B']"
msgid "Set position B"
msgstr "Ange position B"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6706011
msgctxt ""
"MovieAnimation['Applicable for creating an animation from \n"
"point A to B (not when the MovieCamera \n"
"target or MovieObjects are set up to \n"
"follow a route).\n"
"\n"
"1. Select and activate the MovieCamera \n"
"or MovieObjects you want to configure.\n"
"\n"
"2. For MovieCameras, position the 3D \n"
"view with the desired framing to be \n"
"the end of the animation (position B), \n"
"then click on Set position B.\n"
"\n"
"3. For MovieObjects, position and/or \n"
"rotate them to the final position, then \n"
"click on this button.']"
msgid ""
"Applicable for creating an animation from \n"
"point A to B (not when the MovieCamera \n"
"target or MovieObjects are set up to \n"
"follow a route).\n"
"\n"
"1. Select and activate the MovieCamera \n"
"or MovieObjects you want to configure.\n"
"\n"
"2. For MovieCameras, position the 3D \n"
"view with the desired framing to be \n"
"the end of the animation (position B), \n"
"then click on Set position B.\n"
"\n"
"3. For MovieObjects, position and/or \n"
"rotate them to the final position, then \n"
"click on this button."
msgstr ""
"Gäller för att skapa en\n"
"animering från punkt A till\n"
"B (inte när målet för\n"
"MovieCamera eller\n"
"MovieObjects är inställt att\n"
"följa en väg). 1. Välj och\n"
"aktivera den MovieCamera\n"
"eller de MovieObjects som du\n"
"vill konfigurera. 2. För\n"
"MovieCamera: placera 3D-vyn\n"
"med önskad inramning vid\n"
"slutet av animeringen\n"
"(position B) och klicka\n"
"sedan på Ange position B. 3.\n"
"För MovieObjects: placera\n"
"och/eller rotera dem till slutpositionen och klicka sedan på den här knappen."

