msgid ""
"Select at least one MovieCamera or MovieObject \n"
"to create a Clapperboard!"
msgstr ""
"Välj minst en MovieCamera eller ett\n"
"MovieObject för att skapa en klappa!"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6706049
msgctxt ""
"MovieClapperboard['To create a Clapperboard the pre-selected objects \n"
"must be MovieCamera or MovieObjects!']"
msgid ""
"To create a Clapperboard the pre-selected objects \n"
"must be MovieCamera or MovieObjects!"
msgstr ""
"För att skapa en klappa måste de förvalda\n"
"objekten vara MovieCamera eller MovieObjects!"

